DROP SCHEMA dmd CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 5 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to table dmd.m
drop cascades to table dmd.p
drop cascades to table dmd.c
drop cascades to table dmd.u
drop cascades to type dmd.mood
